Dad: Be patient, Rachel. She will be here soon.

3
00:00:09.939 --> 00:00:17.932
Ricky & Rachel: Welcome home, Grandma! We missed

4
00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:28.009
you! Grandma: Hello, my dears. I missed you

5
00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.952
too. Ricky: How was your

6
00:00:29.953 --> 00:00:35.604
trip? Grandma: It was wonderful, Ricky. I had a lot of

7
00:00:35.605 --> 00:00:42.249
fun. My baby! Hello. I have missed

8
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.103
you! Ricky: I walked him every day,

9
00:00:45.104 --> 00:00:47.113
Grandma. Rachel: I

10
